          <ol class="crumbs"><li><a href="/">Home</a></li><li><a href="/#services">Services</a></li><li>Pediatric Oncology</li></ol>
          <h1 id="po-title" data-fx="wipe">Pediatric Oncology Treatment in <span class="grad-text">Bangalore</span></h1>
          <p class="phero__sub" data-fx="fade" style="--d:.15s">Pediatric oncology is the specialised care of babies, children and teenagers with cancer and serious blood disorders. Childhood cancers are rare, but most of them respond very well to treatment, and many children are cured.</p>
          <div class="hero__acts" data-fx="fade" style="--d:.25s">
            <a class="btn btn--grad" href="/contact?topic=pediatric-oncology">Book a consultation<svg class="ic ic--go"><use href="#i-go"/></svg></a>
            <a class="btn btn--line" href="tel:+917899756677"><svg class="ic"><use href="#i-phone"/></svg>+91 78997 56677</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="phero__pic phero__pic--art" data-fx="iris" style="--d:.15s">
          <img src="/assets/images/illustrations/pediatric-oncology.svg" alt="Illustration of a child with a heart and blood cells, representing childhood cancer care" width="400" height="400" fetchpriority="high">
        </div>
